{
  "name": "VEED AI Talking Head Video Generator with Multi-Platform Publishing",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# VEED AI Talking Head Video Generator\n\nThis workflow generates AI avatar videos from images and text using **VEED Fabric 1.0**, with automated multi-platform publishing.\n\n## How It Works\n1. **Input**: Add video requests to a Google Sheet\n2. **TTS**: Generate speech using OpenAI or ElevenLabs\n3. **Video**: VEED creates a talking head video\n4. **Approval**: Email notification with approve/reject\n5. **Publish**: Auto-post to TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, LinkedIn, X, Facebook\n\n## Requirements\n- Fal.ai API Key (for VEED)\n- Google OAuth (Sheets, Drive, Gmail)\n- TTS: OpenAI or ElevenLabs API Key\n- Social Media OAuth credentials (for publishing)\n\n## Quick Start\n1. Create Google Sheet with required columns\n2. Set up credentials in n8n\n3. Configure node placeholders (see Setup note)\n4. Activate workflow\n\n**Node:** n8n-nodes-veed\n**Author:** VEED.io",
        "height": 1424,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "6c6ce0ea-eabe-4223-bdf5-dc0fe718cdc1",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2864,
        1040
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Create Google Sheet\nCreate a new Google Sheet with these columns:\n- `AVATAR_IMAGE_URL` - Public URL to portrait image\n- `NARRATION_TEXT` - Text for the avatar to speak\n- `TTS_PROVIDER` - \"openai\" or \"elevenlabs\"\n- `VOICE_ID` - Voice ID (e.g., \"alloy\" for OpenAI)\n- `VIDEO_TITLE` - Title for the video\n- `VIDEO_DESCRIPTION` - Description text\n- `PLATFORMS` - Comma-separated: tiktok,instagram,youtube,linkedin,x,facebook\n- `ASPECT_RATIO` - \"9:16\", \"16:9\", or \"1:1\"\n- `RESOLUTION` - \"480p\" or \"720p\"\n- `STATUS` - Set to \"pending\"\n\n### Step 2: Configure Credentials\n1. **Fal.ai** - Get key at fal.ai/dashboard/keys\n2. **Google OAuth** - For Gmail, Drive, Sheets\n3. **OpenAI** - platform.openai.com/api-keys\n4. **ElevenLabs** - elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys\n\n### Step 3: Update Node Placeholders\nOpen each node and replace:\n- **Google Sheets nodes**: Set your Google Sheet ID (from URL: docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_ID/edit)\n- **Upload to Drive**: Set your Google Drive folder ID for audio files\n- **Send Approval Email**: Set your approval email address\n- **Send Report Email**: Set notification email address\n\n### Step 4: Social Media Setup (Optional)\nFor each platform you want to publish to:\n- **Instagram**: Set YOUR_INSTAGRAM_BUSINESS_ACCOUNT_ID\n- **Facebook**: Set YOUR_FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID  \n- **LinkedIn**: Set YOUR_LINKEDIN_PERSON_URN\n- Configure OAuth2 credentials for each platform",
        "height": 1424,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ae4b17ea-7dd9-4072-b969-5dd53d5759cf",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3280,
        1040
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Trigger & Input\n\nWorkflow triggers either:\n- **Manual**: Click \"Test workflow\"\n- **Scheduled**: Every 15 minutes\n\nFetches rows from Google Sheets where `STATUS = pending`",
        "height": 1432,
        "width": 712,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "338bd9f9-5474-46f3-9c96-7e5e2d65f632",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3728,
        1040
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Text-to-Speech Generation\n\nChoose TTS provider in your Google Sheet:\n\n**OpenAI TTS** (default)\n- Model: tts-1-hd\n- Voices: alloy, echo, fable, nova, onyx, shimmer\n\n**ElevenLabs**\n- Model: eleven_multilingual_v2\n- Use voice ID from your ElevenLabs dashboard\n\nAudio is uploaded to Google Drive and made publicly accessible for VEED.",
        "height": 1424,
        "width": 1192,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "925e9437-ea40-4432-8fce-f9f9d87e8fd6",
      "name": "Sticky Note - TTS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4448,
        1040
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. VEED Video Generation\n\nUsing **VEED Fabric 1.0** model via Fal.ai\n\n**Requirements:**\n- Front-facing portrait photo (URL)\n- Audio file (MP3 from Google Drive)\n\n**Options:**\n- Resolution: 480p (faster) or 720p (better)\n- Aspect Ratio: 9:16 (TikTok/Reels), 16:9 (YouTube), 1:1 (Feed)\n\n**Processing Time:** 5-15 minutes depending on video length",
        "height": 1420,
        "width": 488,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "5e206ab5-7e20-4707-a2b5-98a54969632c",
      "name": "Sticky Note - VEED",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        5648,
        1040
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Approval Workflow\n\nAfter video generation, an email is sent with:\n- Video preview link\n- Video metadata (title, description, platforms)\n- **Approve** / **Reject** buttons\n\n**Timeout:** 24 hours\n**If no response:** Video remains pending\n**If rejected:** Status updated to \"rejected\" in Google Sheet",
        "height": 1416,
        "width": 728,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "537757ef-2084-4bea-83cf-f7315c4a16fd",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        6144,
        1040
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5. Multi-Platform Publishing\n\nSupported platforms (configure in PLATFORMS column):\n\n**TikTok** - Content Posting API v2 (URL pull)\n**Instagram** - Reels API (requires Business Account)\n**YouTube** - Auto-detects Shorts for <60s videos with 9:16\n**LinkedIn** - Post as Person or Organization\n**X/Twitter** - OAuth1 for upload + OAuth2 for posting (max 140s)\n**Facebook** - Posts to Page (not personal profile)\n\n*All errors are captured - workflow continues if one platform fails*",
        "height": 1412,
        "width": 1472
      },
      "id": "b0df2f7e-4bc0-4ac8-bfd4-1d454d9f056d",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Publishing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        6880,
        1040
      ]
    },
